{"ID":"20240205164738-iqgy51p","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164738-iqgy51p","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164738-iqgy51p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110314-aljpp24\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165616-9jeh75c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206110314-aljpp24\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:169,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:169\u0026#125;","title":"233鳖甲","type":"doc","updated":"20240821155902"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206110314-aljpp24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110314-aljpp24","updated":"20240206110322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于安徽、江苏、湖北、河南等地。\n【性状】\t为卵圆形或椭圆形的骨片，背部微隆起，前后端微向内卷曲。长约1023cm，宽817cm，厚约5mm。背甲中央有不显明的骨节隆起，两侧各有八条左右对称的横凹纹。背面为灰褐色并有皱褶及突起状斑点。甲的边缘呈齿状，类白色。腹面灰白色，有骨隆起明显，两侧对称的肋各8条。质坚硬。臭微腥，味咸。\n【性味】\t咸，寒。\n【功效】\t滋肾潜阳，软坚散结。主治骨蒸劳热、疟母、胁下坚硬、腰痛，经闭症瘕等症。\n【注解】\t“子裙”：指鳖甲上所附的硬皮，其边缘厚而软，形成肉鳍，也称为“裙边”。\n【附注】\t鳖 (Trionyx sinensis / Pelodiscus sinensis) 在《世界自然保护联盟濒危物种红色名录》中被列为易危物种。另外，该物种受香港野生动物保护条例 (第170章) 保护。"}]},{"ID":"20240206110314-h9dvhay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206110314-h9dvhay","updated":"20240206110314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110314-qzjznkh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165616-mxxzawp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165616-mxxzawp","updated":"20240626195016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 685px;","style":"width: 675px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖甲-20240205165616-sa8eq70.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 675px;\" parent-style=\"width: 685px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 447px;","style":"width: 437px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖甲2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖甲2-20240205165616-qjyupf5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 437px;\" parent-style=\"width: 447px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821155038-6ttx2hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821155038-6ttx2hf","updated":"20240821155902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 768px;","style":"width: 758px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖-20240821155038-7868m66.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 758px;\" parent-style=\"width: 768px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 389px;","style":"width: 379px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖 1-20240821155902-9x4u4p6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 379px;\" parent-style=\"width: 389px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165616-9jeh75c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165616-9jeh75c","updated":"20240821155037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 568px;","style":"width: 558px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖-20240626195156-bku3ohs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 558px;\" parent-style=\"width: 568px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 648px;","style":"width: 638px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖6-20240626195812-c9wo7ec.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 638px;\" parent-style=\"width: 648px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240626195221-0lha7ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626195221-0lha7ja","updated":"20240821154958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 440px;","style":"width: 430px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖5-20240626195858-bbxj5cw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 430px;\" parent-style=\"width: 440px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 686px;","style":"width: 676px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鳖4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鳖4-20240626195941-xfz8z6c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 676px;\" parent-style=\"width: 686px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240626195255-gy35s9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626195255-gy35s9o","updated":"20240821155001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626195255-sv4von0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612130243-brf3b5x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130243-brf3b5x"}},{"ID":"20240612130244-6gstxmj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130244-6gstxmj","updated":"20240612130249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130244-wtfsoo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130244-wtfsoo4","updated":"20240612130244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130244-hx232pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130244-hx232pp","updated":"20240612130244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主心腹症瘕坚积，寒热，去痞息肉，阴蚀，痔恶肉。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130244-pjb34am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130244-pjb34am","updated":"20240612130244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生丹阳，取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130244-zccxfu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130244-zccxfu0","updated":"20240612130244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：鳖，甲虫也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130320-lux9n6f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130320-lux9n6f"}},{"ID":"20240612130336-jnhs2nl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130336-jnhs2nl","updated":"20240612130342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130336-993qgf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130336-993qgf7","updated":"20240612130336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲咸平治劳热，止疟破 下气血，更消阴蚀与痔疮，堕胎止崩宽儿胁，肉味虽甘补中气，阴虚之人乃可啜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130336-7nxxr9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130336-7nxxr9n","updated":"20240612130336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其听以眼，故称守神。甲，介虫之甲函也。无毒。主尸疰劳瘦骨热，疗温疟劳疟老疟，心腹 瘕坚积寒热，止上气急满，消恶血并扑损瘀血，去鼻中 肉，阴蚀痔恶肉，消疮肿肠痈，妇人漏下五色，羸瘦，催生堕胎，女子经闭，小儿胁下坚痫疾。又治卒腰痛及石淋，杵末酒下。多忘善误，丙午日取甲着衣带上。丈夫阴痈医不能治，取鳖头烧灰，鸡子白调敷之。历年脱肛及产后阴脱，取灰干掺托上。用九肋多裙重七两者，生剔去肉，取甲酽醋炙黄色，去劳热用小便煮一日夜，恶矾石。肉，主补中益气，峻补阴，去血热及湿痹，但不可久食则损人，以其性冷耳。有独目者，厌下有如王字者，头足不缩者，三足独足者，目四陷者，皆不可食。胸前有软骨谓之丑，食之令人水肿，若误中其毒，令人昏塞，以黄 、吴蓝煎汤，服之立解。又合苋菜食之，生虫、生鳖瘕；合鸡子食之杀人。又江中有阔一二丈者，名鼋肉，补，以盐淹可食。主湿气、诸邪气、血热，杀蛊毒，消百药毒，疗诸恶疮瘰 ，功同鳖甲。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130354-sooc2oz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130354-sooc2oz"}},{"ID":"20240612130407-7gbqisz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130407-7gbqisz","updated":"20240612130412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草经解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130407-ajai85e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130407-ajai85e","updated":"20240612130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气平．味咸．无毒．主心腹症瘕．坚积寒热．去痞疾息肉．阴蚀痔核恶肉．（醋炙）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130407-ex7p88k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130407-ex7p88k","updated":"20240612130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲气平．禀天秋收之金气．入手太阴肺经．味咸无毒．得地北方之水味．入足少阴肾经．气味俱降．阴也．心腹者．厥阴肝经．经行之地也．积而有形可征谓之症．假物而成者谓之瘕．坚硬之积．致发寒热．厥阴肝气凝聚．十分亢矣．鳖甲气平入肺．肺平可以制肝．味咸可以软坚．所以主之也．痞者肝气滞也．咸平能制肝而软坚．故亦主之．息肉阴蚀痔恶肉一生于鼻．鼻者肺之窍也．一生于二便．二便肾之窍也．入肺肾而软坚．所以消一切恶肉也．"}]},{"ID":"20240612130407-x20g8ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130407-x20g8ne","updated":"20240612130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制方】"}]},{"ID":"20240612130407-w9dd3rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130407-w9dd3rx","updated":"20240612130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲同牛膝、当归、陈皮、首乌、知母、麦冬．治久疟．同知母、石膏、麦冬、贝母、竹叶．治温疟．同青蒿、麦冬、五味、生地、杞子、牛膝．治骨蒸劳．"}]},{"ID":"20240612130500-oo87lgs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130500-oo87lgs"}},{"ID":"20240612130501-6nfiyii","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130501-6nfiyii","updated":"20240612130507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130501-3658lyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130501-3658lyg","updated":"20240612130501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130501-lykgj62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130501-lykgj62","updated":"20240612130501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】咸平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130501-3eet2d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130501-3eet2d0","updated":"20240612130501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主心腹症瘕坚积，寒热，去痞疾，息肉，阴蚀，痔核，恶肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130501-1yo9zw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130501-1yo9zw1","updated":"20240612130501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶鳖，介虫也。水居陆生，穹脊连胁，与龟同类。四缘有肉如裙，故曰龟甲裹肉，鳖甲裹骨，无耳，以目为听，与蛇鼋为匹。夏月孕乳，其抱以影。陆佃云∶鱼满三千六百，则蛟龙引之而飞，纳鳖守之则免，故一名守神，亦名河伯从事。修治，取绿色九肋，重七两者为上，用六一泥，固瓶子底，待干，置甲于中，欲治症块，及寒心，用头醋三升，入瓶内，大火煎尽，去裙留骨，炙干用。欲治劳热，以童便一斗二升，煎尽，去裙留骨，焙干，石臼中捣成粉，以鸡 皮裹之，取东流水三斗，以盆盛水，阁于盆上，一宿取用，力有万倍也。恶矾石、理石。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130501-4pfrybu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130501-4pfrybu","updated":"20240612130529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶鳖无耳，以眼听，故其目不可瞥，识精于明，复识精于听也。不唯精专肝窍，胆亦异众而味大辛，穹脊连胁，胁亦少阳胆府所属，此木金交互，故得声色叠用，而肝为胆藏，取决更相亲耳。以余 之，若以胆开聋瞽，必色斯明，声斯聪，彼施诸房术者，风斯下矣。味咸走血软坚，为厥阴肝，少阳胆、血分之气药也。盖肝藏血，设所藏非精，所守非神，致阴凝至坚，为症瘕痞积、息肉恶肉、阴蚀痔核者，软之，决之，亦藉胆断使去者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130545-qxlf64w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130545-qxlf64w"}},{"ID":"20240612130552-ix5jwte","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130552-ix5jwte","updated":"20240612130556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《药性解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130556-ovo27s0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130556-ovo27s0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲，味咸，性平，无毒，入肺、脾二经。主骨蒸劳嗽、积聚癥瘕、膍肉阴蚀痔疽、疮肿瘀血，催生堕胎，妇人五色漏下。九肋者佳。按：丹溪云，鳖甲属金与土，肺脾之所以入也。须生取之，煮脱者不堪用。肉性大冷，过食伤脾。癥瘕勿食，恐益其疾。同鸡食成瘕，同鸡子食能杀人。同苋菜食生血，鳖同芥子食发恶疾，不可不慎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130418-zgeqxyz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130418-zgeqxyz"}},{"ID":"20240612130420-ucjf1uc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-ucjf1uc","updated":"20240612130424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-9vcie5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-9vcie5y","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲，味咸，气平，无毒。醋炙用之。散 癖症瘕及息肉、阴蚀、痔疽，除痨瘦骨蒸、并温疟往来寒热，愈肠痈消肿，下瘀血堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-eqpypcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-eqpypcn","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉，性亦不冷，项下有软骨，亦不必检去。鳖甲善能攻坚，又不损气，阴阳上下，有痞滞不除者，皆宜用之。但宜研末调服，世人俱炙片，入汤药中煎之，则不得其功耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-wieueha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-wieueha","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或疑鳖肉补阴，鳖甲攻坚，一物而相反，恐未必然之说也。夫鳖原阴物，以阴补阴，又何疑乎？君之所疑者，以鳖甲之攻坚也。不知鳖性善藏，凡小有隙地，鳖必用甲以钻入之。是其力全在于甲，故用甲以攻坚，原有至理，非私臆也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-6n9ylxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-6n9ylxv","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问鳖甲可多用乎？曰∶虽其性善攻，而其味仍补。但肉则补多而攻少，甲则攻多而补亦多也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-g6jg7sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-g6jg7sn","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问鳖甲善杀痨虫，有之乎？曰∶不杀痨虫，何以能除痨瘦骨蒸。骨蒸之病，何以有虫乎？盖虫得湿热而自生，非尽由于传染，因热而得汗，因汗而又热，绝似潮汐之无差，阴阳之有准，安得而不生虫乎？且此虫又不生于肠胃之间，偏生于骨髓之内，不用鳖甲，安得入至阴之中，引群阴之药以滋其髓乎？倘止大补其阴，而不用杀虫之味，则所生之髓，止足供虫之用。然杀虫之药又多耗髓，虫死而骨髓空虚，热仍未去，热未去，而虫又生，病终无已时也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-wr1q0d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-wr1q0d8","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲杀虫，而又补至阴之水，所以治骨蒸之病最宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-kcsldtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-kcsldtp","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问鳖甲杀骨中之虫，不知助之何药，杀虫而又补髓也？曰∶杀骨中之虫，只消鳖甲一味足矣，所佐之补阴者宜商。铎受异人之传，欲与天下共商之。方用鳖甲一斤，醋炙，益之地骨皮半斤，丹皮四两，熟地一斤，山茱萸半斤，地栗粉半斤，白芍、白术、薏仁各四两，玄参三两，北五味子二两，沙参六两，各为末，山药一斤，为糊，打为丸。久服虫尽死，而骨蒸亦愈。（〔批〕此方奇甚灵甚，痨瘵之症，亟宜服之。）铎观其方，妙在用鳖甲为君，地栗粉、山茱萸为佐使，以攻杀其内外之虫。又妙在群阴之药不寒不热，凉骨中之热，即生骨中之精，补攻兼施，似可常服而收功者也。世不少明眼之人，必能知此方之妙也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-7uulfh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-7uulfh9","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或疑龟甲可以煎膏，而鳖甲独无煎膏者，岂不可为膏乎。然而龟、鳖实皆阴物，何以古人绝无有论及之者？曰∶鳖甲不可作膏，前人亦尝论及，但惜略举其端而不畅论，今请大彰其义。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130420-mqn9cvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130420-mqn9cvd","updated":"20240612130420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夫龟与鳖，虽同是阴类，而性实不同。龟性喜出，而鳖性喜入，龟性静而不动，而鳖性动而不静。故龟长于补而鳖长于攻，龟可为膏以滋阴，而鳖可为末以攻坚也。滋阴者，可以久服受益，攻坚者，可以暂用成功。虽鳖甲入之补阴之中、攻坚之内，未尝不可久用以滋阴，而终不可如龟之煎膏单用之而常服，此古人所以取龟作膏，而独弃鳖甲也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130407-sc1kjwz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130407-sc1kjwz"}},{"ID":"20240612130356-de2oun9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130356-de2oun9","updated":"20240612130400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130356-5tdy3g6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130356-5tdy3g6","updated":"20240612130356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸平，无毒。主治心腹症瘕，坚积寒热，去痞疾，息肉，阴蚀，痔核，恶肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130356-gjqcspr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130356-gjqcspr","updated":"20240612130356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（鳖，水中介虫也，江河池泽处处有之。水居陆生，穹脊连胁，与龟同类。夏日孚乳，其抱以影。《埤雅》云∶卵生思抱，其状随日影而转，在水中上必有浮沫，名鳖津，人以此取之。《淮南子》曰∶鳖无耳，以目听，名曰神守。陆佃云∶鱼满三千六百，则蛟龙引之而飞，纳鳖守之则免，故一名神守。管子云∶鳖畏蚊，生鳖遇蚊叮则死，老鳖得蚊煮而烂。熏蚊者，复用鳖甲，物性相报复，如是异哉。甲以九肋者为胜，入药以醋炙黄用。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130356-xozxkq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130356-xozxkq3","updated":"20240612130356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖生池泽，随日影而转，在水中必有津沫上浮，盖禀少阴水气，而上通于君火之日。又，甲介属金，性主攻利，气味咸平，禀水气也。主治心腹症瘕，坚积寒热者，言心腹之内，血气不和，则为症为瘕，内坚积而身寒热。鳖禀少阴之气，上通君火之神，神气内藏，故治在内之症瘕坚积。又曰∶去痞疾者，言症瘕坚积，身发寒热。若痞疾，则身无热寒，而鳖甲亦能去也。夫心腹痞积，病藏于内。若息肉，阴蚀，痔核，恶肉，则病见于外。鳖甲属金，金主攻利，故在外之恶肉阴痔，亦能去也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130334-mp50bqh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130334-mp50bqh"}},{"ID":"20240612130322-qr97wf7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130322-qr97wf7","updated":"20240612130326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130322-w9vzbbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130322-w9vzbbg","updated":"20240612130322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味酸、平，无毒。主心腹症瘕，坚积寒热，去痞疾、蚀肉、阴蚀、痔核恶肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130322-a2bw0l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130322-a2bw0l8","updated":"20240612130322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【述】鳖甲气平，禀金气而入肺；味咸无毒，得水味而入肾。心腹者，合心下大腹小腹，以及胁肋而言也。症瘕坚硬之积，致发寒热，为厥阴之肝气凝聚；鳖甲气平，可以制肝，味咸可以软坚，所以主之也。痞者，肝气滞也，咸平能制肝而软坚，故亦主之。蚀肉、阴蚀、痔核恶肉，一生于鼻，鼻者肺之窍也；一生于二便，二便者肾之窍也；入肺肾而软坚，所以消一切恶肉也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130309-tv3goa3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130309-tv3goa3"}},{"ID":"20240612130311-o29ty93","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130311-o29ty93","updated":"20240612130316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130311-lkhba9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130311-lkhba9l","updated":"20240612130311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味咸寒，色青入肝，益阴散结。治温疟、疟母，痨热骨蒸。鳖肉∶益阴凉血。鳖血养血益阴。鳖头∶治脱肛、阴挺。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130300-hs48nhm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130300-hs48nhm"}},{"ID":"20240612130302-tlu9gab","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130302-tlu9gab","updated":"20240612130302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲"}]},{"ID":"20240612130302-hnciiif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130302-hnciiif","updated":"20240612130302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味咸寒，色青入肝，益阴散结。治温疟、疟母，痨热骨蒸。鳖肉∶益阴凉血。鳖血养血益阴。鳖头∶治脱肛、阴挺。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125921-rqflni9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612125921-rqflni9"}},{"ID":"20240612125922-vpf8t51","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125922-vpf8t51","updated":"20240612125929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125922-qsvguas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125922-qsvguas","updated":"20240612125922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．主治温疟，血瘕，腰痛，小儿胁下坚．肉，味甘，治伤中，益气，补不足．生丹阳，取无时．（恶矾石．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125922-sc1harw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125922-sc1harw","updated":"20240612125922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶鳖甲，味咸，平．主心腹症瘕，坚积寒热，去痞息肉，阴蚀痔恶肉．生池泽．"}]},{"ID":"20240612130025-6p28av5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130025-6p28av5"}},{"ID":"20240612130026-nisp3y0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130026-nisp3y0","updated":"20240612130031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130026-8xdhaa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130026-8xdhaa0","updated":"20240612130026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九肋者佳，煮熟者不如生得者，仍以酽醋炙黄色用。经中不言治劳，惟《蜀本·药性论》云“治劳瘦、除骨热”，后人遂用之，然甚有据，亦不可过剂。头血涂脱肛。又，烧头灰亦治。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130054-rhznrbc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130054-rhznrbc"}},{"ID":"20240612130149-odh8muu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130149-odh8muu","updated":"20240612130155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130149-6x6jxyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130149-6x6jxyk","updated":"20240612130149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全得天地至阴之气，故味咸、平、无毒，象水明矣。但甲色青而应木，故专入肝益肾，为软坚除热补虚除 ，温疟寒热， 瘕坚积，痞疾息肉，阴蚀痔疮，疟母劳热，血瘕骨蒸劳复，产后蓐劳之要药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130149-s877vx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130149-s877vx0","updated":"20240612130149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲，劳瘦骨蒸，温疟，往来寒热，癖瘕 ，息肉阴蚀痔疽，退伏热于骨中，长阴气于肝肾，小儿胁下坚，妇人产后痨，去痞化积，血瘕腰痛，愈肠痈，消肿下瘀血，堕胎。肉味甘而性冷，主伤中益气，凉血热，补阴虚，不宜过度，以其性冷，孕妇食之，生子项短。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130149-k4au4ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130149-k4au4ql","updated":"20240612130149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶龟甲，以自败者为佳，鳖甲，以不经汤煮者方胜，若肝肾无热者忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130206-y2qp81z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130206-y2qp81z"}},{"ID":"20240612130207-9jez1th","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130207-9jez1th","updated":"20240612130211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草害利》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130207-6l7xuj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130207-6l7xuj5","updated":"20240612130207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔害〕其性阴寒，肝虚无热者忌用。鳖肉凉血补阴，阴冷而难消，脾虚者大忌。恶矾石，忌苋菜、鸡子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130207-cp951a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130207-cp951a5","updated":"20240612130207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔利〕咸寒平属阴，色青入肝，补阴退热而散结，治厥阴血分之病。劳瘦骨蒸寒热温疟母，及经阻难产，肠痈疮肿，惊痫斑痘，元气虚羸，邪陷中焦，鳖甲能益阴热。鳖色青治皆肝症，龟色黑，主治皆肾症。同归补阴，实有分别。龟板以自败，大者为佳。鳖肉凉血补阴，亦治疟痢，加生姜砂糖，煮作羹食，名鳖糖汤。鳖血如用柴胡加入数匙，而不过表。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130207-9uipuic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130207-9uipuic","updated":"20240612130207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕色绿，九肋九重七雨者为上。醋炙或酒炙黄，或生用。刮白，除其腥气，恐有倒胃之弊。治劳，童便炙亦可，熬膏良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130231-dr7eaia","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130231-dr7eaia"}},{"ID":"20240612130233-cmk0gak","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130233-cmk0gak","updated":"20240612130237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130233-9dbtb76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130233-9dbtb76","updated":"20240612130233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸。性平。无毒。禀天地至阴之气而生。降也。阴也。忌见汤。恶矾。反苋菜、鸡子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130233-4dx781u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130233-4dx781u","updated":"20240612130233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主心腹症癖。坚积寒热。去痞疾。痔核恶肉。（本经）疗温疟。血瘕腰痛。小儿胁下去血复食复目）【归经】入肝经。兼入肺脾二经。为益阴除热散结之品。（兼宣剂肝经血分药）【前论】严用和曰。鳖色青入肝。故所主者皆足厥阴血分之病。龟色黑属肾。故所主者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130233-goefdb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130233-goefdb3","updated":"20240612130233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"皆退【禁忌】经疏曰。妊娠。及阴虚胃弱。阴虚泄泻。产后泄泻。产后饮食不消。不思食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130233-6ra8d8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130233-6ra8d8j","updated":"20240612130233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及呕【炮制】弘景曰。凡用。须生取甲。剔去肉者。为妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130216-7gjirrv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130216-7gjirrv"}},{"ID":"20240612130217-81hp35z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130217-81hp35z","updated":"20240612130224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130217-y7oxm3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130217-y7oxm3u","updated":"20240612130217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒属阴，入肝补阴除热，散结软坚，治肝经血分之病，为疟家要药。鳖肉凉血补阴，治疟痢，忌苋菜勿同食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130149-bf8z0tt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130149-bf8z0tt"}},{"ID":"20240612130134-0psc9zz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-0psc9zz","updated":"20240612130141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《中药炮制》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-dc9s1wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-dc9s1wu","updated":"20240612130134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『来源』本品为鳖科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鳖"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥背甲。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-opg1fp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-opg1fp6","updated":"20240612130134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『常用名』别甲、别盖、甲鱼壳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-lhflzkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-lhflzkt","updated":"20240612130134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『产地』湖南、安徽、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-13cte7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-13cte7z","updated":"20240612130134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『采收季节』四季收集。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-5jzmjup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-5jzmjup","updated":"20240612130134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『炮制方法』生鳖甲，放入缸内，用水浸泡，夏秋季约泡20天，春冬季泡30天，至黑衣和余肉烂掉，取出冲洗数次，再日晒夜露2星期，至无臭气为度。制鳖甲，每斤用醋3两，炒法与龟板相同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-kq6o5e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-kq6o5e3","updated":"20240612130134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『用量』3～12克。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-84fw2h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-84fw2h8","updated":"20240612130134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『贮存』装木箱内加盖。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130134-lrhkndz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130134-lrhkndz"}},{"ID":"20240612130124-x2dm972","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130124-x2dm972","updated":"20240612130128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130124-noww01j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130124-noww01j","updated":"20240612130124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（龟鳖）泻肝分积热除劳嗽骨蒸"}]},{"ID":"20240612130124-ndnp73k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130124-ndnp73k","updated":"20240612130124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲（专入肝）。味咸气平。色青。书虽载属补肝。（青入肝。）与龟载属补肾（黑入肾。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130124-wso4w7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130124-wso4w7f","updated":"20240612130124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各别。然究皆属除热削肝之品。（介虫皆属阴寒。故能除热。）非真滋肝药也。凡厥阴血分积热。而见劳嗽骨蒸。寒热往来。温疟疟母。及腰腹胁坚。血瘕痔核。经阻产难。疡痈疮肿。惊痫斑痘等症。服此咸平。能以消除。（诸症皆就阴虚邪入而论。故用鳖甲入阴除热散结。）若肝虚无热。切忌。鳖以七肋九肋者佳。以其得阳之数耳！其用必取乎肋。以肋属肝故耳。但食品中惟鳖叵测。如三足两头。并项强腹赤。皆有大毒。能以杀人。不可不慎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130122-u0sopbc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130122-u0sopbc"}},{"ID":"20240612130112-ovqypep","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130112-ovqypep","updated":"20240612130117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130112-z38qt13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130112-z38qt13","updated":"20240612130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名上甲"}]},{"ID":"20240612130112-eoivso7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130112-eoivso7","updated":"20240612130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸平无毒。九肋七肋者佳。以其得阳数也。但多有摘去下肋伪充七肋者，亦有半边支肋、半边双肋者，此团鱼与鳖交合而生，不若纯支肋者为优。醋 酥炙各随本方。治疟母淋灰汤煮糜如饴，用龟用大者力胜，鳖用小者力优。妊娠勿食鳖肉。与苋菜、鸭卵合食尤忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130112-6br8qp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130112-6br8qp7","updated":"20240612130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主心腹症瘕坚积寒热，去痞疾息肉，阴蚀痔核，恶肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130112-6difwv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130112-6difwv2","updated":"20240612130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖色青，入厥阴肝经及冲脉，为阴中之阳。阳奇阴偶，故取支肋为肝经之响导。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130112-cee152a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130112-cee152a","updated":"20240612130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其所主者， 疟、疟母，虚劳寒热，症瘕痞疾，经水阴疮，不出《本经》主治也。凡骨蒸劳热自汗皆用之，为其能滋肝经之火也。与龟甲同类，并主阴经血分之病。龟用腹，腹属肾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130112-8akhfy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130112-8akhfy7","updated":"20240612130112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖用肋，肋属肝，然究竟是削肝之剂，非补肝药也。妊妇忌用，以其能伐肝破血也。肝虚无热禁之。 灰研极细末疗汤火伤皮绽肉烂者并效，干则麻油调敷，湿则干掺，其痛立止。其解火毒，疗骨蒸，杀瘵虫之功可默悟矣。鳖头烧灰酒服疗小儿脱肛，妇人阴脱下坠，取其善缩之性也，生血涂之尤效。沈圣符曰，食品中惟鳖最为叵测，其间多有大毒不减河豚者，如三足两头，人所共弃，项强腹赤毒可伤人。予邻余子坦曾见蛇盘屡跌而成鳖者，四生之中物物皆有变化，无足异也。且有鳖宝生鳖腹中之说，说者以为诞妄，姑置罔闻。近日枫江吴氏买一鳖，烹之辄作人言。其家以为怪也，添火烹之，剖腹果得一物长约三寸，须眉宛然。圣符邀予往看，验其鳖形背高耸起，稍异寻常。圣符属笔命记，以为嗜味伤生之警。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130110-ihbmt83","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130110-ihbmt83"}},{"ID":"20240612130055-vqgzig5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-vqgzig5","updated":"20240612130101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-usyayvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-usyayvo","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治。滋阴。退热。益气。除骨蒸热。破症结。冷瘕。血瘕。劳热劳复。劳瘦。腰痛阴毒。痔核。石淋妇人难产。经闭产后阴脱。阴蚀。小儿痫疾。疗溃痈肠痈。烂疽。肉滋阴益肾。鳖甲丸。鳖甲（炙）何首乌（制）各四两。川朴草果仁广皮山楂六神曲黄芩麦芽（炒）半夏（姜制）各二两。常山柴胡蓬莪术三棱各一两五钱。水泛丸梧子大。每服三钱。姜汤下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-6c5t0av","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-6c5t0av","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治三阴疮久不愈。忌鸡子。又方。鳖甲酸枣仁（炒）羌活牛膝（酒炒）绵（炒）人参各一两。五味子五钱。研末。蜜丸梧子大。每服三四十丸。温酒下。治胆虚不眠。四肢无力。又方。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-dgnwhtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-dgnwhtu","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲地骨皮各三钱。五味子二两。研末。蜜丸梧子大。每服三四十丸。空腹温酒下。妇人淡醋汤下。治劳嗽。及耳鸣眼花。一切虚证。又方。鳖甲（醋炙）二两。土瓜根桂心三棱（醋炒）丹皮牛膝大黄（锉微炒）诃黎勒皮琥珀（细研）桃仁（制）各一两。研末。蜜丸梧子大。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-duy9upl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-duy9upl","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每服十五至三十丸。桃仁汤下治妇人骨蒸劳。肌黄肉瘦。经水不通。胁下症癖。时发刺痛。又方。鳖甲紫菀桂心川芎防风牛膝当归秦艽人参桃仁琥珀各一两。黄赤芍虻虫（制）水蛭（制）鬼箭羽白术羌活各七钱五分。熟地一两五钱。麝香二钱五分。研末。蜜丸梧子大。每服三十丸。空腹温酒下。治妇人血风劳气。四肢羸瘦疼痛。经滞食减。渐加虚困。又方。鳖甲（米醋一小盏化砂一两。涂甲炙。以醋尽为度。）三两。附子（炮）三棱（炮）干漆（炒烟尽）木香各一两。吴茱萸五钱。（汤泡微炒）大黄（醋拌炒）二两。研末。醋煮面糊丸梧子大。每服二十丸。空腹温酒下。治痞结胃脘如杯。积久不散。腹胁疼痛。体瘦成劳。又方。鳖甲刺皮（炙焦）穿山甲（炙焦）枯矾附子猪牙皂角（炙焦存性）各五钱。研末。蒸饼糊丸梧子大。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-pj4kpk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-pj4kpk6","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每服二十丸。食前米饮下。日三次。治肠痔。鳖甲地黄汤。鳖甲（醋炙）熟地（酒浸）柴胡当归（酒浸）麦冬石斛白术茯苓秦艽各一两。人参肉桂炙草各五钱。为散。每服四钱。加生姜四片。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-ickcydu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-ickcydu","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌梅半个。水煎服。治热劳怔忡。妇人血室有干血羸瘦。鳖甲散。鳖甲（醋涂炙黄）三分。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-yleyul9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-yleyul9","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槟榔三颗。沉香漏芦牛蒡子（微炒）使君子赤芍诃黎勒皮炙草各五钱。为散。每服一钱。水煎服。治小儿无辜疳。项细腹大。毛发干立。又方。鳖甲露蜂房蛇蜕猪后悬蹄刺皮各二钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-5h5wmn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-5h5wmn3","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麝香一分。除麝香外。余烧存性。研末和匀。每服一钱。生地汤空腹调下。更以末敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-4z8t6jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-4z8t6jp","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治五痔脓血淋漓或肿痛坚硬下坠。又方。鳖甲（醋炙）槟榔赤茯苓各一两。郁李仁木通各七钱五分。咀。每服八钱。水煎服。治香港脚心腹胀满。小便不利。又方。鳖甲柴胡知母秦艽当归青蒿乌梅地骨皮水煎服。治骨蒸。又方。鳖甲（醋炙）白术桂心常山柴胡各一两。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130055-4iiig9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130055-4iiig9a","updated":"20240612130055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡蛎（）五钱。为散。每服五钱。水煎服。治久疟。鳖血煎。芜荑柴胡川芎各一两。人参五钱。使君子二十一枚。胡黄连宣黄连各七钱。吴茱萸一两。鳖血一盏。浸二连吴萸一宿。次早炒干。去萸血。取二连与余药研末。粟米粉糊丸麻子大。每服十丸。食前汤下。治小儿疳劳。鳖甲胶。主治补肝阴清肺热。治劳瘦骨蒸。往来寒热。腰痛胁坚。血瘕。痔核。妇人经闭难产。小儿惊痫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130011-ls4gu5o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130011-ls4gu5o"}},{"ID":"20240612130012-url5dyv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-url5dyv","updated":"20240612130017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-2owng64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-2owng64","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，无毒。主心腹症瘕，坚积，寒热，去痞，息肉，阴蚀，痔，恶肉，疗温疟，血瘕，腰痛，小儿胁下坚。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-2rlky3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-2rlky3r","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，主伤中，益气，补不足。生丹阳池泽。取无时。（恶矾石）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-566sk42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-566sk42","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶生取甲，剔去肉为好，不用煮脱者。今看有连厌及干岩便好，若上有甲，两边骨出，已被煮出，用之当炙。夏月锉鳖，以赤苋包置湿地，则变化生鳖。人有裹鳖甲屑，经五月，皆能变成鳖子。此其肉亦不足食，多作症瘕。其目陷者，及合鸡子食之，杀人。不可合苋菜食之，其厌下有如王字形者，亦不可食。唐本注云∶鳖头烧为灰，主小儿诸疾，又主产后阴脱下坠，尸疰，心腹痛。今按陈藏器本草云∶鳖，主热气湿痹，腹中激热。细擘，五味煮食之，当微泄。膏，脱人毛发，拔去涂孔中即不生。若欲重生者，以白犬乳汁涂拔处，当龟形，食之令人患水病。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本云∶以绿色仍重七两以上者，置醋五升于中，缓火逼之令尽，然后去裙捣入。药性论云∶鳖甲，使，恶理石。能主劳瘦，下气，除骨热，骨节间劳热，结实拥塞。治妇人漏下五色羸瘦者，但烧甲令黄色，末，清酒服之方寸匕。日二服。又方∶诃梨勒皮、干姜末等分为丸，空心下三十丸，再服，治症癖病。又，治 癖气，可醋炙黄，末，牛乳一合，散一匙，调可琥珀、大黄作散，酒服二钱匕，少时恶血即下。若妇人小肠中血下尽，即脱肛。孟诜云∶鳖，主妇人漏下，羸瘦。中春食之美，夏月有少腥气。其甲华子云∶鳖，益气调中，妇人带下，治血瘕腰痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-9lk8xdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-9lk8xdb","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲，去血气，破症结恶血，堕胎，消疮肿，并扑损瘀血，疟疾，肠痈。头烧灰疗脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-xz1av4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-xz1av4e","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶鳖，生丹阳池泽，今处处有之。以岳州、沅江其甲有九肋者为胜。取无时，仍生取甲，剔去肉为好，不用煮脱者，但看有连厌及干岩便真，若上两边骨出，是已被煮也。古今治妇人漏下五色羸瘦者，烧甲令黄色，筛末，酒服方寸匕，日二。又，合诃梨勒皮、干姜，三物等分为丸，空腹三十丸，治癖最良。又，醋炙令黄捣末，以牛乳之，主 气。其肉良之亦益人，补虚，去血热。但不可久食，则损人，以有软骨谓之丑，食当去之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-op0k0aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-op0k0aa","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不可与苋菜同食，令生鳖瘕，久则难治。又其头、足不能缩及独目者，并大毒，不可食，食之杀人。其头烧灰，主脱肛。南人养鱼池中，多畜鳖，云令鱼不随雾起。鳖之类，三足者为能（奴来切），大寒而有毒，主折伤，止痛，化血。生捣其肉及血敷之。道家云∶可辟诸厌秽死气，画像亦能止之。无裙而头、足不缩者名，食之令人昏塞，误中其毒，以黄 、吴蓝煎服之，立解。其壳亦主传尸劳及女子经闭。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-wchayys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-wchayys","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其最大者为鼋，江中或有阔一、二丈者，南人亦捕而食之。云其肉有五色而白多，卵大如鸡、鸭子，一产一、二百枚，人亦掘取，以盐淹可食。其甲亦主五脏邪气，妇人血热。又下有（音驼）甲条云∶生南海池泽，今江湖极多，即鼍也，形似守宫、陵鲤辈，而长一、二丈，背、尾俱有鳞甲，善攻 岸，夜则鸣吼，舟人甚畏之。南人食其肉，云色白如鸡，但发冷气痼疾。其皮亦中冒鼓。皮及骨烧灰，研末，米饮服。主肠风痔疾，甚者入红鸡冠花末，白矾灰末，和之。空腹服便差。今医方∶鲜有用鼋、 甲者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-ro6hk1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-ro6hk1z","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公曰凡使，要绿色、九肋、多裙、重七两者为上。治气破块，消症，定心，药中用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-ls51wmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-ls51wmi","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个鳖甲，以六一泥固济瓶子底了，干，于大火以物 于中，与头醋下火煎之，尽三升醋为度，仍去裙并肋骨了，方∶炙干，然入药中用。又，治劳去热药中用，根据前泥，用童子小便煮昼夜，尽小便一斗二升为度，后去裙留骨，于石上捶，石臼中捣成粉了，以鸡KT 皮裹之，取东流阁于盆上一宿，至明任用，力有万倍也。圣惠方∶治久患劳疟瘴等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-nqycypc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-nqycypc","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方∶用鳖甲三两，涂酥炙令黄，去裙为末。临发时温酒调下二钱匕。又方∶治小儿尸疰劳瘦，或枚，烧灰杵末，新汲水下半钱匕。千金方∶妊娠勿食鳖肉，令子项短。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-ieskrs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-ieskrs9","updated":"20240612130012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"愈。死鳖头一枚，烧令烟绝，杵末。以敷肛上，手按挪之。千金翼∶治丈夫阴以鸡子白和敷之，良。肘后方∶治笃病新起，早服方寸匕。至时用火炙，无不断。又方∶猝腰痛不得俯仰。鳖甲一枚捣末，服方寸匕。又方∶治人心孔昏塞，匕。日二、三寸匕，立出鳖甲及头烧如小豆握，水二升，煎取五合。食前服一钱匕，食后蜜水服一钱匕。姚和众∶小儿因痢脱肛。鳖头、甲烧灰末，取粉扑之。左传云∶三足谓之能，不可食也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130012-dw3acg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130012-dw3acg3","updated":"20240612130040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶鳖甲，九肋者佳，煮熟者不如生得者，仍以酽醋炙黄色用。经中不言治劳，惟《蜀本·药性论》云“治劳瘦、除骨热”，后人遂用之，然甚有据，亦不可过剂。头血涂脱肛。又，烧头灰亦治。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125910-ozcdyok","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612125910-ozcdyok"}},{"ID":"20240612125911-qdaf3zv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125911-qdaf3zv","updated":"20240612125916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125911-4ez7il7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125911-4ez7il7","updated":"20240612125911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，无毒。主治心腹症瘕，坚积，寒热，去痞，息肉，阴蚀，痔，恶肉。治温疟，血瘕，腰痛，小儿胁下坚。肉∶味甘，主伤中，益气，补不足。生丹阳池泽，取无时。（恶矾石。）生取甲，剔去肉为好，不用煮脱者。今看有连厣及干岩便好，若上有甲，两边骨出，已被煮也，用之当炙。夏月锉鳖，以赤苋包置湿地，则变化生鳖。人有裹鳖甲屑，经五月，皆能变成鳖子。此其肉亦不足食，多作症瘕。其目陷者，及合鸡子食之，杀人。不可合苋菜食之。其厣下有如王字形者，亦不可食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125706-vzytuz1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612125706-vzytuz1"}},{"ID":"20240612125853-7djaqg8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125853-7djaqg8","updated":"20240612125904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125853-ws0jqgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125853-ws0jqgm","updated":"20240612125853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补阴退热．"}]},{"ID":"20240612125853-wlf7kpv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125853-wlf7kpv","updated":"20240612125853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒属阴．色青入肝．治劳瘦骨蒸．往来寒热．温疟疟母．（疟必暑邪、类多阴虚之人、日久不愈、元气虚羸、邪陷中焦、则结为疟母、鳖甲能益阴除热而散结、故为治疟要药．）腰痛胁坚．血瘕痔核．（咸能软坚．）经阻产难．肠痈疮肿．惊痫斑痘．厥阴血分之病．（时珍曰∶介虫阴类、故皆补阴．龟色黑、主治皆肾经、鳖色青、主治皆肝经、同属补阴、实有分别．）肝无热者忌．色绿、九肋、重七两者为上．醋炙．若治劳．童便炙．亦可熬膏．鳖肉、凉血补阴．亦治疟痢．（煮作羹食、加生姜沙糖、不用盐酱、名鳖糖汤．）冷而难消．"}]},{"ID":"20240612125853-uqzqjyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125853-uqzqjyq","updated":"20240612125853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾虚者大忌．恶矾石．忌苋菜、鸡子．"}]},{"ID":"20240612125725-f5s8srx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612125725-f5s8srx"}},{"ID":"20240612125841-spwkqju","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125841-spwkqju","updated":"20240612125849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125841-3ffwi8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125841-3ffwi8w","updated":"20240612125841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性本咸寒．入肝达络．功行瘀癖．退热潜阳．（鳖甲色青入肝．咸寒无毒．通经络．散瘀血．为厥阴血分之药．凡水族介类之属．皆能益阴潜阳．咸寒之性则同．其所入之处又各不同耳．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125726-h6nic1s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612125726-h6nic1s"}},{"ID":"20240612125830-77qxyzu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125830-77qxyzu","updated":"20240612125835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳖甲《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125830-aoohliq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125830-aoohliq","updated":"20240612125830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸平。主心腹症瘕坚积。寒热。去痞、息肉、阴蚀、痔、恶肉。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125830-hchwav7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125830-hchwav7","updated":"20240612125830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮津穹脊。慕臭纷纷。知希九肋。愿妄重裙。形还沃苋。烟解驱蚊。鱼飞神守。擐甲策勋。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125830-kw77qsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125830-kw77qsm","updated":"20240612125830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"埤雅。鳖之所在。上有浮沫。名鳖津。尔雅翼。形圆而穹脊。皮日休纪。群小茸茸。如慕臭之鳖。摭言。沅江鳖甲。九肋者希。五代史补。僧谦光曰。但愿得鳖长两重裙。唐类函。鳖甲包置湿地。以赤苋汁沃之。即化生。李时珍曰。烧烟熏蚊即化。埤雅。鱼满三百六十。龙即引飞出水内。鳖则鱼不复去。故一名神守。钟会文。擐甲厉兵。潘岳文。诔德策勋。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125706-vv0fe12","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612125706-vv0fe12"}},{"ID":"20240612125718-wa439gh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-wa439gh","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：鳖甲"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-rkqvkmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-rkqvkmy","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-mzp7mty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-mzp7mty","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Biē Jiǎ"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-j7ro58v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-j7ro58v","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jr2pgfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jr2pgfj","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 团鱼盖、脚鱼壳、上甲、甲鱼"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-wj08c3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-wj08c3y","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-vp472s8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-vp472s8","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" CARAPAX TRIONYCIS"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-wrcrxsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-wrcrxsv","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-k74wra3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-k74wra3","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为鳖科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鳖"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Trionyx sinensis Wiegmann的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"背甲"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可捕捉，以秋、冬二季为多，捕捉后杀死，置沸水中烫至背甲上的硬皮能剥落时，取出，剥取背甲，除去残肉，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-hwprxcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-hwprxcf","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jokvmax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jokvmax","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈椭圆形或卵圆形，背面隆起，长10～15cm，宽9～14cm。外表面黑褐色或墨绿色，略有光泽，具细网状皱纹及灰黄色或灰白色斑点，中间有一条纵棱，两侧各有左右对称的横凹纹8条，外皮脱落后，可见锯齿状嵌接缝。内表面类白色，中部有突起的脊椎骨，颈骨向内卷曲，两侧各有肋骨8条，伸出边缘。质坚硬。气微腥，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-4ykwc0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-4ykwc0y","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-yt2q7rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-yt2q7rw","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-tnhlv2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-tnhlv2a","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-cng1udh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-cng1udh","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：置蒸锅内，沸水蒸45分钟，取出，放入热水中，立即用硬刷除去皮肉，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-kywf54i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-kywf54i","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"醋鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：取净鳖甲，照烫法（附录Ⅱ D）用砂烫至表面淡黄色，取出，醋淬，干燥。用时捣碎。每100kg鳖甲，用醋20kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7r4tlr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7r4tlr1","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-cqppsk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-cqppsk6","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-q431o1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-q431o1b","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-d0xd40m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-d0xd40m","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，微寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-z933kzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-z933kzo","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-1ifv5tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-1ifv5tw","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 滋阴潜阳，软坚散结，退热除蒸。用于阴虚发热，劳热骨蒸，虚风内动，经闭，癓瘕，久疟疟母。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-g9595e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-g9595e7","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-1byh17g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-1byh17g","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 9～24g，捣碎，先煎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-hirdifg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-hirdifg","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-x9dr69d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-x9dr69d","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7i0tn3r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7i0tn3r","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：鳖甲"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-gzlf5nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-gzlf5nr","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-9r6la04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-9r6la04","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Biē Jiǎ"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-zifle91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-zifle91","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-ilq0tig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-ilq0tig","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上甲（《证治要诀》），鳖壳（《医林纂要》），团鱼甲（《河北药材》），鳖盖子（《山西中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-mkna5cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-mkna5cn","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-ypyjxqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-ypyjxqi","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-9h82vx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-9h82vx5","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-sv60364","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-sv60364","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为鳖科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中华鳖"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"背甲"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。3～9月捕捉。捕得后，砍去鳖头，将鳖身入沸水内煮1～2小时，至甲上硬皮能脱落时，取出，剥下背甲，刮净残肉后晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-ud8cbn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-ud8cbn7","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-ofqebbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-ofqebbe","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多生活于湖泊、小河及池溏旁的沙泥里。6～7月间产卵。分布很广，由东北至海南岛以及湖北、安徽、四川、云南、陕西、甘肃等地均有。主产湖北、安徽、江苏、河南、湖南、浙江、江西等地。此外，四川、福建、陕西、甘肃、贵州亦产。以湖北、安徽二省产量最大。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-hamqtii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-hamqtii","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-59dpcg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-59dpcg5","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中华鳖，又名：团鱼（《纲目》），甲鱼（《随息居饮食谱》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-gj8vysv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-gj8vysv","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体呈椭圆形，背面中央凸起，边缘凹入。腹背均有甲。头尖，颈粗长，吻突出，吻端有1对鼻孔。眼小，瞳孔圆形。颈基部无颗粒状疣；头颈可完全缩入甲内。背腹甲均无角质板而被有软皮。背面橄榄绿色，或黑棕色，上有表皮形成的小疣，呈纵行排列；边缘柔软，俗称裙边。腹面黄白色，有淡绿色斑。背、腹骨板间无缘板接连。前肢5指，仅内侧3指有爪；后肢趾亦同。指、趾间具蹼。雄性体较扁，尾较长，末端露出于甲边；雌性相反。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-5i75jwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-5i75jwz","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jm3pqe2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jm3pqe2","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 完整的干燥鳖甲呈卵圆形或椭圆形，长10～20厘米，宽7～15厘米，厚约5毫米。背面微隆起，灰褐色或黑绿色，并有皱褶及突起状的灰黄色或灰白色斑点，甲中央有不显明的骨节隆起，两侧各有8条明显的横向的锯齿状衔接缝，左右边缘可见8对齿状突起，呈类白色。甲里面白色，中央有突起的脊椎骨，两侧各有8条肋骨。质坚硬，衔接缝处易断裂。气微腥，味咸。以个大、甲厚、无残肉、洁净无腐臭味者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-xnbmean","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-xnbmean","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-85a54sa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-85a54sa","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含动物胶、角蛋白、碘质、维生素D等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-okgvlfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-okgvlfu","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-d8m1e4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-d8m1e4r","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鳖甲：用水浸泡，去净皮肉，洗净，晒干。醋鳖甲：先取净砂入锅内炒热，然后加入净鳖甲，炒至表面微黄色为度，取出筛去砂子，置醋盆内略浸，取出，用水漂洗，晒干。（每鳖甲100斤，用醋30斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-ut5c46v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-ut5c46v","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《品汇精要》：\"常用酥炙黄色。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-x8axwlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-x8axwlq","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-uzaflzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-uzaflzf","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-6nsqceq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-6nsqceq","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-s9amus9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-s9amus9","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肝、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-tqws948","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-tqws948","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"入足厥阴、少阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-gb4fbdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-gb4fbdt","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-cq49vot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-cq49vot","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-8ys4qr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-8ys4qr6","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-07jiwdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-07jiwdn","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-y5y3l9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-y5y3l9u","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草从新》：\"咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-bx3l7e9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-bx3l7e9","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-fjnummv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-fjnummv","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾胃阳衰，食减便溏或孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-px01rnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-px01rnx","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"恶矾石。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-bolhzbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-bolhzbq","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"恶理石。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-z0z4u6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-z0z4u6y","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"妊娠禁用，凡阴虚胃弱、阴虚泄泻、产后泄泻、产后饮食不消、不思食及呕恶等证咸忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-z7ju43y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-z7ju43y","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》：\"肝虚无热，禁之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-4qd9bf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-4qd9bf5","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《得配本草》：\"冷劳症瘕人不宜服，血燥者禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-0y8fell","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-0y8fell","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-abj27u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-abj27u9","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 养阴清热，平肝熄风，软坚散结。治劳热骨蒸，阴虚风动，劳疟疟母，症瘕痃癖，经闭经漏，小儿惊痫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-112f0sd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-112f0sd","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主心腹症瘕坚积、寒热，去痞、息肉、阴蚀，痔（核）、恶肉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-rydy2md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-rydy2md","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗温疟，血瘕，腰痛，小儿胁下坚。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-h8le20t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-h8le20t","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"主宿食、症块、痃癖气、冷瘕、劳瘦，下气，除骨热，骨节间劳热，结实壅塞。治妇人漏下五色羸瘦者。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7srgvn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7srgvn1","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"去血气，破症结、恶血，堕胎，消疮肿并扑损瘀血，疟疾，肠痈。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-6qkebr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-6qkebr7","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草衍义补遗》：\"补阴补气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-uap7hc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-uap7hc9","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《医学入门》：\"主劳疟、老疟，女子经闭，小儿痢疾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-gl09nku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-gl09nku","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《纲目》：\"除老疟疟母，阴毒腹痛，劳复，食复，斑疽烦喘，妇人难产，产后阴脱，丈夫阴疮，石淋；敛溃痈。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-0dr5i3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-0dr5i3l","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《江西中药》：\"治软骨病。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-hxeokhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-hxeokhs","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-z825btz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-z825btz","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～8钱，熬膏或入丸、散。外用：研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-vzc2089","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-vzc2089","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-k4n8qo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-k4n8qo5","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治男女骨蒸劳瘦：鳖甲一枚，以醋炙黄，入胡黄连二钱，为末。青蒿煎汤服方寸匕。（孙思邈）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-68kb46f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-68kb46f","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治骨蒸夜热劳瘦，骨节烦热，或咳嗽有血者：鳖甲一斤（滚水洗，去油垢净），北沙参四两，怀熟地、麦门冬各六两，白茯苓三两，陈广皮一两。水五十碗，煎十碗，渣再煎，滤出清汁，微火熬成膏，炼蜜四两收。每早晚各服数匙，白汤调下。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jowmenm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jowmenm","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治热邪深入下焦，脉沉数，舌干齿黑，手指但觉蠕动，急防痉厥：炙甘草六钱，干地黄六钱，生白芍六钱，阿胶三钱，麦冬五钱（去心），麻仁三钱，生牡蛎五钱，生鳖甲八钱。水八杯，煮取八分三杯，分三次服。（《温病条辨》二甲复脉汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-6mb4ekd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-6mb4ekd","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治老疟久不断者：先炙鳖甲，捣末，方寸匕，至时令三服尽。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7j7e5xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7j7e5xd","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治温疟：知母，鳖甲（炙）、常山各二两，地骨皮三两，竹叶一升（切），石膏四两。上以水七升，煮二升五合，分温三服。忌蒜、热面、猪、鱼。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-qpgnun2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-qpgnun2","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治疟母：鳖甲十二分（炙），乌扇三分（烧），黄芩三分，柴胡六分，鼠妇三分（熬），干姜三分，大黄三分，芍药五分，桂枝三分，葶苈一分（熬），石苇三分（去毛），厚朴三分，牡丹五分（去心），瞿麦二分，紫葳三分，阿胶三分（炙），蜂蜜四分（炙），赤硝十二分，蜣螂六分（熬），桃仁二分，半夏一分，人参一分，蟅虫五分（熬）。上二十三味，为末，取煅灶下灰一斗，清酒一斛五斗，浸灰，候酒尽一半，着鳖甲于中，煮令泛烂如胶漆，绞取汁，纳诸药煎为丸，如梧子大，空心服七丸，日三服。（《金匮要略》鳖甲煎丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-l2zl5kz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-l2zl5kz","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治癥癖：鳖甲、诃黎勒皮、干姜末。等分为丸，空心下三十丸，再服。（《药性论》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-vlqd56a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-vlqd56a","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治心腹癥瘕血积：鳖甲一两（汤泡洗净，米醋浸一宿、火上炙干，再淬再炙，以甲酥为度，研极细），琥珀三锅（研极细），大黄五钱（酒拌炒）。上共研细作散。每早服二钱，白汤调下。（《甄氏家乘方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-gm4prsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-gm4prsk","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治妇人月水不利，腹胁妨闷，背膊烦疼：鳖甲二两（涂醋炙令黄，去裙榈），川大黄一两（锉，微炒），琥珀一两半。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸，如梧桐子大。以温酒下二十丸。（《圣惠方》鳖甲丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-a17hjo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-a17hjo6","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治妇人漏下五色，羸瘦、骨节间痛：鳖甲烧令黄，为末，酒调服方寸匕，日三。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-58qlshq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-58qlshq","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治吐血不止：鳖甲一两（锉作片子），蛤粉一两（鳖甲相和，于铫内炒香黄色），熟干地黄一两半（暴干）。上三味捣为细散。每服二钱匕，食后腊茶清调下，服药讫，可睡少时。（《圣济总录》鳖甲散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-mpijgrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-mpijgrv","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治卒腰痛不得俯仰：鳖甲一枚（炙，捣筛）。服方寸匕，食后，日三服。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-8m3mzh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-8m3mzh6","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治石淋：鳖甲杵末，以酒服方寸匕，日二、三，下石子瘥。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-q577ad6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-q577ad6","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治上气喘急，不得睡卧，腹胁有积气：鳖甲一两（涂醋炙令黄，去裙襕），杏仁半两（汤浸，去皮、尖，麸炒微黄），赤茯苓一两，木香一两。上药捣筛为散，每服五钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，灯心一大束，煎至六分，去滓，不计时候，温服。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-8qr1k0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-8qr1k0i","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治阴虚梦泄：鳖甲烧研，每用一字，以酒半盏，童尿半盏，葱白七寸同煎，去葱，日晡时服之，出臭汗为度。（《医垒元戎》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jp62zao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jp62zao","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治产后早起中风冷，泄痢及带下：鳖甲如手大，当归、黄连、干姜各二两，黄柏长一尺、广三寸。上五味细切，以水七升，煮取三升，去滓，分三服，日三。（《千金方》鳖甲汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-2b0n5d3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-2b0n5d3","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治小儿痫：鳖甲炙令黄，捣为末，取一钱，乳服，亦可蜜丸如小豆大服。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-34mgx30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-34mgx30","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治肠痈内痛：鳖甲烧存性，研，水服一钱，日三。（刘禹锡《传信方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-t8vkfwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-t8vkfwg","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治痈疽不敛，不拘发背一切疮：鳖甲烧存性，研掺。（《怪证奇方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-reqos3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-reqos3n","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治痔，肛边生鼠乳，气壅疼痛：鳖甲三两（涂醋炙令黄，去裙襕），槟榔二两。上药捣细罗为散，每于食前，以粥饮调下二钱。（《圣惠方》鳖甲散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-qk0bahj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-qk0bahj","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）治丈夫阴头痈肿：鳖甲一枚，上一味，烧焦末之，以鸡子白和敷之。（《千金翼方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-zz27grg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-zz27grg","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）治牙痛：鳖甲。焙干轧成细末，贮于干燥器皿内备用临用时，取鳖甲粉0.5克放在烟斗内烟叶的表面上，点燃当烟吸。（《全展选编·五宫科》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-j5jfmb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-j5jfmb4","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-mclcups","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-mclcups","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草衍义》：\"鳖甲，《经》中不言治劳，惟蜀本《药性论》云，治劳魔，除骨热，后人遂用之。然甚有据，亦不可过剂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-6yjdsu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-6yjdsu3","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"鳖甲主消散者以其味兼乎平，平亦辛也，咸能软坚，辛能走散，故《本经》主症瘕、坚积、寒热，去痞疾、息肉、阴蚀、痔核、恶肉；《别录》疗温疟者，以疟必暑邪为病，类多阴虚，水衰之人，乃为暑所深中，邪入阴分，故出并于阳而热甚，入并于阴而寒甚，元气虚羸，则邪陷而中焦不治，甚则结为疟母。甲能益阴除热而泊散，故为治疟之要药，亦是退劳热在骨及阴虚往来寒热之上品，血瘕腰痛，小儿胁下坚，皆阴分血病，宜其悉主之矣。劳复、女劳复为必须之药；劳瘦骨蒸，非此不除；产后阴脱，资之尤急。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7vpkkcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7vpkkcn","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》；\"鳖甲，除阴虚热疟，解劳热骨蒸之药也。魏景山曰，鳖甲虫也，与龟同类而异种，亦禀至阴之性，入肝，统主厥阴血分为病，……厥阴血闭邪结，渐至寒热，为癥瘕、为痞胀、为疟疾、为淋沥、为骨蒸者，咸得主之。倘阳虚胃弱，食饮不消，呕恶泄泻者，阴虚胃弱，吞咽不下，咳逆短气，升降不足息者，用此无益也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-vxkx541","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-vxkx541","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草述》：\"鳖甲，类言其益阴，是矣，第丹溪云补阴而更云补气，盖气有阳气阴气之殊，本于《内经》可证也。经曰，阴虚则无气，无气则死。盖唯是真阴之气，有化乃有生，有生即有化，故《本经》首云主治心腹癥瘕坚积寒热，即《别录》暨甄权、《日华子本草》，无不以温疟、血瘕、宿食、冷块、痃癖、冷瘕及破癥结为言也。至丹溪乃揭出补阴补气以为言，可谓探其要领矣。宗奭所谓《经》中不言治劳，然治虚劳多用之，亦甚有据者，以是言合于方书之主治，良不谬也。如清骨散，固谓其治骨蒸劳热也；如扶羸汤，是除骨蒸劳热而兼以益精血之味也。又麦煎散，治少男室女骨蒸黄瘦口臭肌热盗汗，此证乃七情之为病也。虚劳发热，未有不由瘀血者，而瘀血未有不由内伤者。凡虚劳证，大抵心下引胁俱痛，盖滞血不消，新血无以养之也。故麦煎散中用鳖甲，而同于干漆以化积。又秦艽鳖甲散，此透肌退热之一方也。以上数方是皆同鳖甲而用者，虽其佐助之义各有所主，而共用鳖甲以入诸味者，不外于补阴气以为功也。又如治疟母宜鳖甲煎丸，又疟母丸，固益阴气者也。且治疟、所名疟母，即结为癥瘕者，更可见诸《本草》之用鳖甲，无不以疗血瘕癥块云云为言者，固有见于兹味阴气之专，即化以为生也。至于积聚之所治，……如鳖甲丸之于肝积为肥气，干漆丸及半夏散之于心积为伏粱，又鳖甲丸之于脾积为痞气，四方虽各有不同，然总归于入足厥阴、手少阴、足太阴之脏也，以鳖甲阴气之专，入三阴而行其积，固有得于气之相应者矣。又即女子漏下而鳖甲疗之，却又用行瘀血，是岂谓其能止复能行乎?盖此味专补阴气，如漏下，属阴气虚而不能固也，如瘀血，亦属阴气虚而不能流贯于经络也。但就女子经血一证，可以推其所治之诸证，固惟是专补阴气，如经所谓知其要者，一言而终也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-6qhskr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-6qhskr4","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草新编》：\"鳖甲善能攻坚，又不损气，阴阳上下有痞滞不除者，皆宜用之。但宜研末调服，世人俱炙片入汤药中煮之，则不得其功矣。\"又：\"或疑鳖甲善杀痨虫，有之乎?曰：不杀痨虫，何以能除痨瘦骨蒸。……鳖甲杀虫，而又补至阴之水，所以治骨蒸之病最宜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-b8xmhv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-b8xmhv3","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本经逢原》：\"鳖甲，凡骨蒸劳热自汗皆用之，为其能滋肝经之火岜。然究竟是削肝之剂，非补肝药也。妊妇忌用，以其能伐肝破血也。肝虚无热禁之。极灰研极细末，疗汤火伤皮绽肉烂者并效，干则麻油调敷，湿则干掺，其痛立止，其解火毒，疗骨蒸、杀瘵虫之功，可默悟矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-uinpvct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-uinpvct","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-rhb3gr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-rhb3gr1","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-senfxtg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-senfxtg","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：鳖甲"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-1pwy8z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-1pwy8z9","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jyxk4kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jyxk4kx","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Biē Jiǎ"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-yopuu7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-yopuu7t","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-4anlm09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-4anlm09","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上甲、鳖壳、甲鱼壳、团鱼壳、团鱼盖、团鱼甲、鳖盖子"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-8xsi14y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-8xsi14y","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-atejtth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-atejtth","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Turtle Shell"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-sbs8ueh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-sbs8ueh","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-qf7nicg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-qf7nicg","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-mekjby6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-mekjby6","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-d484sc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-d484sc1","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为鳖科动物中华鳖及山瑞鳖的背甲。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-vwf0mzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-vwf0mzk","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Trionyx sinensis (Wiegmann) 2.Trionyx steindachneri Siebenrock"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-6rt1hwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-6rt1hwy","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：在春、夏、秋季捕鳖，用刀割下头，割取背甲，去净残肉，晒干。亦可将鳖体置于沸水中煮1-2h，烫至背甲上的皮能剥落时取出，剥下背甲，去净肉，洗净晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-2v904nl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-2v904nl","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-zkhe3ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-zkhe3ek","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生活于湖泊、河流、池塘及水库等水域。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-rpreptb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-rpreptb","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生活在山区的河流、溪、潭中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-ti4xg3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-ti4xg3k","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.除新疆、宁夏、青海、西藏等地未见报道外，广泛分布于全国各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-uwpnvvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-uwpnvvv","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于广东、海南、广西、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-4uu3dty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-4uu3dty","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-zlrl50o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-zlrl50o","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.中华鳖，体呈椭圆形或近卵圆形，成体全长约30-40cm。头尖，吻长，形成吻突呈短管状；鼻孔位于吻突前端，上下颌缘覆有角质硬鞘，无齿，眼小；瞳孔圆表，鼓膜不明显，颈部可长达70mm以上，颈基部无颗粒状疣，头、颈可完全缩入甲内。背腹甲均无角质板而被有革质软皮，边缘具柔软的较厚的结缔组织，谷称裙边。背面皮肤有突起小疣，成纵行棱起，背部中央稍凸起，椎板8对，肋板8对，无臀板，边缘无缘板相连。背部骨片没有完全骨质化，肋骨与肋板愈合，其末端突出于肋板外侧。四肢较扁平，前肢5指；内侧三指有外露的爪；外侧二指的爪全被皮肤包裹而不外露，后肢趾爪生长情况亦同，指、趾间具蹼而发达。雄性体较扁而尾较长，末端露出于裙边；雌性尾粗短，不露出裙边。泄殖肛孔纵裂。头颈部上面橄榄绿色，下面黄色，下颌至喉部有黄色斑纹，两眼前后有黑纹，眼后头顶部有10余个黑点。体背橄榄绿色或黑棕色，具黑斑，腹部肉黄色，两侧裙边处有绿色大斑纹，近尾部有两团豌豆大的绿色斑纹。前肢上面橄榄绿色；下面淡黄色，后肢上面色较浅。尾部正中为橄榄绿色，余皆为淡黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-1hkqrlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-1hkqrlz","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.山瑞鳖，体近圆形，当体重9kg时，长、宽达36cm×21cm，体重大者可达20kg。体背隆起，皮肤粗糙，体背、边缘、颈基部、四肢及尾部均有大小不等的肉质喜钉状突起；体后部的鼓钉更大而密。边缘内质裙边甚为肥厚。四肢粗壮，侧扁。尾短，略呈扁圆锥形，基部宽，末端尖。体灰黑色、墨绿色、紫黑色或黑青莲色。头、四肢乌黑色或墨绿色。腹面乌黑色带紫，具深色斑块。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-rxso3bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-rxso3bh","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-921z1ut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-921z1ut","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性，鳖的体色随栖息的环境而变化，呈保护色。主要用肺呼吸，营水陆两栖生活，在水中产歇浮到水表面交换空气。性胆怯，喜安静，在风和日丽的表气，常爬到岸上晒背，杂食性，但喜食动物的饵料，如鱼虾及其他动物的内脏等。水温在25-33℃时，摄食旺盛，生长迅速，水温低于15℃时停止摄食，低于12℃时，伏于水底泥中冬眠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-6rxojdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-6rxojdn","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"养殖技术，鳖为雌雄异体，夏季是鳖的繁殖季了，交配后每年5-8月为产卵期。雌鳖常于晚上在岸边的松软泥沙滩上掘穴产卵，然后用沙覆平，每穴7-30枚。自然孵化期50-60天。可人工采卵孵化，温度控制在26-36℃，温度在75%-85%，则孵化期缩短为40-50天孵化率高达90%。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-u35xndn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-u35xndn","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饲养管理，鳖有自相残食的习性，因此按大小分级饲养，饲养密度不可过大。稚鳖期饲料要求营养丰富，易消化，以蚯蚓、熟蛋黄、动物下脚料为好。池水3-5天换1次。幼鳖、成鳖期摄食量大，5-10月每日投饵2次。亲鳖按雌雄4：1或3：1放养，加强秋后的营养，有利于提前发情、交配、产卵。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-enhtzry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-enhtzry","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-uwywbxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-uwywbxm","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，本品呈椭圆形或卵圆形，背面隆起，长10-15cm，宽9-14cm。外表面黑褐色或黑绿色，略有光泽，具细网状皱纹及灰黄色或灰白色斑点，中间有1条纹棱，两侧各有左右对称的横凹纹8条，外皮脱落后，可见锯齿状嵌接缝。内表面类白色，中部有突起的背椎内，颈骨向内卷曲，两侧各有肋骨8条，伸出边缘。质坚硬。气微腥，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7zhdyz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7zhdyz1","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别，骨碎片呈不规则形，大小不一，灰白色或灰黄色，表面有纵向或纵横交错的似网状细密纹理及细点状孔隙，骨陷窝不规则殂、长棱形或细长裂隙状，骨小管隐约可见。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-81iv6zy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-81iv6zy","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-gsn5fbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-gsn5fbw","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 毒性：鳖多糖口服100g/kg，给药后14天，未见有死亡，解剖动物，肉眼未见有病理变化。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-64y9khm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-64y9khm","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-wi2wt89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-wi2wt89","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.中华鳖，背甲含骨胶原（collagen），碳酸钙、磷酸钙，中华鳖多糖（trionyx sinesis polysaccharides），并含天冬氨酸（aspartic acid） ，苏氨酸（threonine），谷氨酸（glutamic acid），甘氨酸（glycine），丙氨酸（alanine），胱氨酸（cystine），缬氨酸（valine），蛋氨酸（methionine），异亮氨酸（isoleucine），亮氨酸（leucine），酪氨酸（tyrosine），苯丙氨酸（phenylalanine），赖氨酸（lysine），组氨酸（histidine），精氨酸（arginine），脯氨酸（proline），丝氨酸（serine）等17种氨基酸，及钙、钠、铝、钾、锰、铜、锌、磷、镁等10多种微量元素养。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-gy5srs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-gy5srs7","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.山瑞鳖，背甲及腹甲含骨胶原、肽类、多种氨基酸，大量钙及磷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-5661gj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-5661gj1","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-kmmgz9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-kmmgz9d","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.强壮作用：鳖多糖0.5、1.0、2.0g/kg灌胃15-20天，能明显提高小鼠耐缺氧能力和抗冷冻作用，可延长小鼠游泳时间，有抗疲劳作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-u0t84tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-u0t84tr","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.免疫促进作用：鳖多糖0.5、1.0、2.0g/kg灌胃15-20天，能显着提高小鼠空斑形成细胞的溶血能力，促进溶血素抗体生成；并增强小鼠迟发型超敏反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-kku6ghs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-kku6ghs","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.其它：以0.5%或1.0%鳖多糖Renger液浸泡蟾蜍坐骨神经腓肠肌标本，有增加收缩高度和画纹面积、延长持续收缩时间的作用。本品能抑制结缔组织的增生，可消失结块；并具有增加血浆蛋白的作用，有谓可用于肝病所致的贫血。本品能抑制结缔组织的增生，故可消结块；并具有增加血浆蛋白的作用，有谓可用于肝病所致的贫血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-8j01g8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-8j01g8w","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-h9tgk8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-h9tgk8w","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鳖甲：用水浸泡，去净皮冈，沈净，晒干。醋鳖甲：先取净砂入锅内炒热，然后加入净鳖甲，炒至表面微黄色为度，取出筛去砂子，置醋盆内略浸，取出，用水漂洗，晒干。(每鳖甲100斤，用醋30斤)《品汇精要》：常用酥炙黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-41they7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-41they7","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7zgbdo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7zgbdo6","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 薄层层析：取本品甲醇提取液点于硅胶G薄层板上，用正丁醇-95%乙醇-冰醋酸-水（4:1:1:2）展开，0.3%茚三酮正丁醇液喷雾，105℃干燥5分钟，以精氨酸、谷氨酸为对照品，样品液色谱在与标准品液色谱的相应位置上，显相同的紫色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-9i7e8ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-9i7e8ve","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-14qz5yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-14qz5yx","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jg8dx1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jg8dx1r","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-y55j1v5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-y55j1v5","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性微寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-3y41cqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-3y41cqm","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-bzlly1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-bzlly1g","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 脾胃虚寒，食少便溏及孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-hj0ehae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-hj0ehae","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-kk5c2um","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-kk5c2um","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 滋阴清热；潜阳熄风；软坚散结。主阴虚发热；劳热骨蒸；热病伤阴；虚风内动；小作惊痫；久疟；疟母；症瘕；经闭"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-389l5x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-389l5x2","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-q9mj26w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-q9mj26w","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，10-30g，先煎；熬膏；或入丸、散。外用：适量，烧存性，研末掺或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-d67s1ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-d67s1ni","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-j7ytvbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-j7ytvbp","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治男女骨蒸劳瘦：鳖甲一枚，以醋炙黄，入胡黄连二钱，为末。青篙煎汤服方寸巴。(孙思邈)②治骨蒸夜热劳瘦，骨节烦热，或咳嗽有血者：鳖甲一斤(滚水洗，去油垢净)，北沙参四两，怀熟地、麦门冬各六两，白茯苓三两，陈广皮一两。水五十碗，煎十碗，渣再煎，滤出清汁，微火熬成膏，炼蜜四两收。每早晚各服数匙，白汤调下。(《本草汇言》)③治热邪深入下焦，脉沉数，舌干齿黑，手指但觉蠕动，急防痉厥：炙甘草六钱，干地黄六钱，生白芍六钱，阿胶三钱，麦冬五钱(去心)，麻仁三钱，生牡蛎五钱，生鳖甲八钱。水八杯，煮取八分三杯，分三次服。(《温病条辨》二甲复脉汤)④治老疟久不断者：先炙鳖甲，捣末，方寸巴，至时令三服尽。(《补缺肘后方》)⑤治温疟：知母、鳖甲(炙)、常山各二两，地骨皮三两，竹叶一升(切)，石膏四两。上以水七升，煮二升五合，分温三服。忌蒜、热面、猪、鱼。(《补缺肘后方》)⑥治疟母：鳖甲十二分(炙)，乌扇三分(烧)，黄芩三分，柴胡六分，鼠妇三分(熬)，干姜三分，大黄三分，芍药五分，桂枝三分，葶苈一分(熬)，石苇三分(去毛)，厚朴三分，牡丹五分(去心)，留麦二分，紫葳三分，阿胶三分(炙)，蜂蜜四分(炙)，赤硝十二分，蜣螂六分(熬)，桃仁二分，半夏一分，人参一分，窗虫五分(熬)。上二十三味，为末，取燃灶下灰一斗，清酒一斛五斗，浸灰，候酒尽一半，着鳖甲于中，煮令泛烂如胶漆，绞取汁，纳诸药煎为九，如梧子大，空心服七九，日三服。(《金匮要略》鳖甲煎丸)⑦治症癖：鳖甲、诃黎勒皮、干姜末。等分为丸，空心下三十丸，再服。(《药性论》)⑧治心腹症瘕血积：鳖甲一两(汤泡洗净、米醋浸一宿、火上炙干，再淬再炙，以甲酥为度，研极细)，琥珀三钱(研极细)，大黄五钱(酒拌炒)。上共研细作散。每早服二钱，白汤调下。(《甄氏家乘方》)⑨治妇人月水不利，腹胁妨闷，背膊烦疼：鳖甲二两(涂醋炙令黄，去裙裥)，川大黄一两(挫，微妙)，琥珀一两半。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸，如梧桐子大。以温酒下二十丸。(《圣惠方》鳖甲丸)⑩治扫人漏下五色，赢瘦、骨节间痛：鳖甲烧令黄，为末，酒调服方寸匕，日三。(《肘后方》)11.治吐血不止：鳖甲一两(锉作片子)，蛤粉一两(鳖甲相和，于铫内炒香黄色)，熟干地黄一两半(暴干)。上三味捣为细散。每服二钱匕，食后腊茶清调下，服药讫，可睡少时，(《圣济总录》鳖甲散)12.治卒腰痛不得俯仰：鳖甲一枚(炙，捣筛)。服方寸匕，食后，日三服。(《补缺肘后方》)13.治石淋：鳖甲杆末，以酒服方寸匕日二、三，下石子瘥。(《肘后方》)14.治上气喘急，不得睡卧，腹胁有积气：鳖甲一两(涂醋炙令黄，去裙裥)，杏仁半两(汤浸，去皮、尖，麸炒微黄)，赤茯苓一两，木香一两。上药捣筛为散，每服五钱，以水一中盏，入生姜半分，灯心一大束，煎至六分，去滓，不计时候，温服。(〈圣惠方》)15.治阴虚梦泄：鳖甲烧研，每用一字，以酒半盏，童尿半盏，葱白七寸同煎，去葱，日哺时服之，出具汗为度。(《医垒元戎》)16.治产后早起中风冷，泄痢及带下：鳖甲如手大，当归、黄连、干姜各二两，黄柏长一只、广三寸。上五味细切，以水七升，煮取三升，去滓，分三服，日三。(《千金方》鳖甲汤)17.治小儿痫：鳖甲炙令黄，捣为末，取一钱，乳服，亦可蜜丸如小豆大服。(《子母秘录》)18.治肠痈内痛：鳖甲烧存性，研，水服一钱，日三。(刘禹锡《传信方》)19.治痈疽不敛，不拘发背一切疮：鳖甲烧存性，研掺。(〈怪证奇方》)20、治痔，肛边生鼠乳，气壅疼痛：鳖甲三两(涂醋炙令黄，去裙裥)，槟榔二两。上药捣细罗为散，每于食前，以粥饮调下二钱。(《圣惠方》鳖甲散)21.治丈夫阴头痈肿：鳖甲一枚，上一味，烧焦末之，以鸡子白和敷之。(《千金翼方》)22.治牙痛：鳖甲。焙干轧成细末，贮于干燥器皿内备用。临用时，取鳖甲粉0．5克放在烟斗内烟叶的表面上，点燃当烟吸。(《全展选编·五官科》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-4zr214j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-4zr214j","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-01sdef0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-01sdef0","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草衍义》：鳖甲，〈经〉中不言冶劳，惟蜀本《药性论》云，治劳瘦，除骨热，后人遂用之。然甚有据，亦不可过剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-brvcfee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-brvcfee","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：鳖甲主消散者以其味兼乎平，平亦辛也，成能软坚，辛能走散，故《本经》主症瘕、坚积、寒热，去痞疾、息肉、阴蚀、痔核、恶肉；《别录》疗温疟者，以疟必暑邪为病，类多阴虑，水衰之人，乃为暑所深中，邪入阴分，故出并于阳而热甚，入并于阴而寒甚，元气虑赢，则邪陷而中焦不治，甚则结为疟母。甲能益阴除热而消散，故为治疟之要药，亦是退劳热在骨及阴虚往来寒热之上品。血瘕腰痛，小儿胁下坚，皆阴分血病，宜其悉主之矣。劳复、女劳复为必须之药；劳瘦骨蒸，非此不除；产后阴脱，资之尤急。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-7ul1qrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-7ul1qrt","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草汇言》：鳖甲，除阴虚热疟，解劳热骨蒸之药也。魏景山曰，鳖甲虫也，与龟同类而异种，亦禀至阴之性、入肝，统主厥阴血分为病，厥阴血闭邪结，渐至寒热，为症瘕、为痞胀、为疟疾、为淋沥、为骨蒸者，咸得主之，倘阳虚胃弱，食饮不消，呕恶泄泻者，阴虚胃弱，吞咽不下，咳逆短气，升降不足息者，用此无益也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-fbpfz3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-fbpfz3c","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草述》：鳖甲，类言其益阴，是矣，第丹溪云补阴而更云补气，盖气有阳气阴气之殊，本于《内经》可证也。《经》曰，阴虚则无气，无气则死。盖唯是真阴之气，有化乃有生，有生即有化，故《本经》首云主治心腹症瘕坚积寒热。即《别录》暨甄权、《日华子本草》无不以温疟、血瘕、宿食、冷块、痃癖、冷瘕及破症结为言也。至丹溪乃揭出补阴补气以为言，可谓探其要领矣。宗爽所谓《经》中不言治劳，然治虚劳多用之，亦甚有据者，以是言合于方书之主治，良不谬也。 清骨散，固谓其洽骨蒸劳热也。如扶赢汤，是除骨蒸劳热而兼以益精血之味也。又麦煎散，治少男室女骨蒸黄瘦口臭肌热盗汗，此证乃七情之为病也。虚劳发热，未有不由瘀血者，而瘀血未有不由内伤者。凡虚劳证，大抵心下引胁俱痛，盖滞血不消，新血无以养之也。故麦煎散中用鳖甲，而同于干漆以化积。又秦艽鳖甲散，此透肌退热之一方也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-2dwzid1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-2dwzid1","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《别录》：疗温疟，血瘕，腰痛，小儿胁下坚。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-jboguj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-jboguj8","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《药性论》：主宿食、症块、痃癖气、冷瘕、劳瘦，下气，除骨热，骨节间劳热，结实壅塞。治妇人漏下五色赢瘦者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-524c78x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-524c78x","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《日华子本草》：去血气，破感结、恶血，堕胎，消疮肿并扑损疚血，疟疾，肠痈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-vwmt9ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-vwmt9ml","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草衍义补遗》：补阴补气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-wjse9fy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-wjse9fy","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《医学入门》：主劳疟、老疟、女子经闭，小儿痫疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-am0ankf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-am0ankf","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《纲目》：除老疟疟母，阴毒腹痛，劳复，食复，斑痘烦喘，妇人难产，产后阴脱，丈夫阴疮，石淋；敛溃痈。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-p2zb986","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-p2zb986","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《江西中药》：治软骨病。"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-74nq8sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-74nq8sk","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612125718-obz1ebw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125718-obz1ebw","updated":"20240612125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612125719-ykxy7kb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612125719-ykxy7kb"}},{"ID":"20240612125721-9ezmh2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612125721-9ezmh2u"}}]}